                {
                  "id": "h-signs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Signs It's Time to Replace Your Fuel Filter",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "signs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-signs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fuel filters rarely fail without warning. Watch for these common symptoms:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-signs-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Loss of power climbing hills"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Engine hesitation"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Longer crank times"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Check engine light"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reduced fuel economy"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Difficulty maintaining highway speeds"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-signs-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These symptoms often appear gradually, making them easy to overlook. Routine inspections during scheduled maintenance help identify restricted filters before performance suffers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-one-part",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fuel Filters Are Just One Part of Preventive Maintenance",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "one-part"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-part-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fuel filters work alongside several other components that protect your engine. A complete preventive maintenance program should also include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-one-part-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Engine oil changes"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Oil filter replacement"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Air filter inspections"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Coolant checks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fuel system inspections"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Belt and hose inspections"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-part-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Regular commercial truck oil change services are another critical part of keeping your diesel engine healthy. Clean oil and clean fuel work together to reduce wear, improve efficiency, and maximize engine life. Keeping up with routine maintenance costs far less than replacing injectors, fuel pumps, or major engine components.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-oem-matters",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why OEM Filters Make a Difference",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "oem-matters"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-oem-matters-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every filter is built to the same standards. High-quality filters provide:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-oem-matters-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Better filtration efficiency"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Proper fuel flow"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Correct pressure ratings"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Longer service life"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improved engine protection"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-oem-matters-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Using filters designed for your specific engine helps maintain proper fuel pressure and ensures reliable performance. At Sun State International, our parts specialists help customers choose filters that meet manufacturer specifications, so you can feel confident you're installing the right components every time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-professional-maintenance",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Professional Maintenance Helps Protect Your Investment",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "professional-maintenance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-maintenance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Replacing a fuel filter may seem like a simple job, but today's diesel engines are more sophisticated than ever.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-maintenance-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Modern fuel systems require:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-professional-maintenance-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Proper priming procedures"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Correct installation"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Inspection for contamination"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fuel pressure verification"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "System diagnostics when needed"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-maintenance-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our factory-trained technicians don't simply replace filters. They inspect the entire fuel system to identify potential issues before they become expensive repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
