                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-running-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we understand that every hour your truck spends in the shop is time it isn't earning revenue. That's why we focus on providing dependable parts, quick turnaround times, and customer service that puts your business first. Whether you need replacement filters, routine maintenance, or expert diagnostics, our experienced team is here to help keep your trucks operating at their best. <a href=\"/service-appointment\">Schedule service with Sun State International</a> today and keep your fuel system performing the way it was designed to.",
                    "align": "left",
